<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Aivio — Turn real life into anywhere else</title>
<meta name="description" content="Shoot a photo or a short clip and remix it instantly into anime, cyberpunk, fantasy, underwater worlds, and more. One tap, infinite worlds — only with Aivio.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#150E22">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://aivio.app/">

<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Aivio — Turn real life into anywhere else">
<meta property="og:description" content="One tap. Infinite worlds. Remix any photo or clip into anime, cyberpunk, fantasy, underwater, and more.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://aivio.app/og-image.jpg">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://aivio.app/">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Aivio — Turn real life into anywhere else">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="One tap. Infinite worlds. Remix any photo or clip instantly.">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://aivio.app/og-image.jpg">

<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3ClinearGradient id='g' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='1'%3E%3Cstop offset='0%25' stop-color='%23FF2E88'/%3E%3Cstop offset='35%25' stop-color='%23FFB84D'/%3E%3Cstop offset='70%25' stop-color='%231FD8C4'/%3E%3Cstop offset='100%25' stop-color='%238B5CF6'/%3E%3C/linearGradient%3E%3C/defs%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='9' fill='url(%23g)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --void:#150E22;
    --panel:#1E1730;
    --panel-2:#251C3B;
    --paper:#F5F2ED;
    --ink:#150E22;
    --ink-soft:#4E4763;
    --muted-dark:#9C93B0;
    --muted-light:#7D7690;
    --line-dark:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    --line-light:#E4DFD5;

    --sun:#FFB84D;
    --magenta:#FF2E88;
    --teal:#1FD8C4;
    --violet:#8B5CF6;
  }

  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Unbounded', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .mono{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace;
    letter-spacing:0.02em;
  }
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  img,svg{display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;}

  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, [tabindex]:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--teal);
    outline-offset:3px;
    border-radius:4px;
  }

  /* ================= dark section base ================= */
  .dark{
    background:var(--void);
    color:#fff;
  }

  /* ================= header ================= */
  header{
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:60;
    background:rgba(21,14,34,0.72);
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }
  .nav{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 32px;
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .logo{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:9px;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#fff;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  .logo-mark{
    width:24px;height:24px;
    border-radius:7px;
    background:conic-gradient(from 180deg, var(--magenta), var(--sun), var(--teal), var(--violet), var(--magenta));
    flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .nav-links{
    display:none;
    gap:34px;
    font-size:14px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  }
  @media(min-width:760px){.nav-links{display:flex;}}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:#fff;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:12px 22px;
    border-radius:100px;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:700;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .15s ease, opacity .15s ease;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .btn-glow{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--magenta), var(--violet));
    color:#fff;
  }
  .btn-glow:hover{transform:translateY(-1px); opacity:.92;}
  .btn-outline{
    border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:#fff;}

  /* ================= hero ================= */
  .hero{
    padding:76px 0 90px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-120px; left:50%;
    width:900px; height:600px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(139,92,246,0.28), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-inner{
    position:relative;
    text-align:center;
    max-width:760px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--teal);
    background:rgba(31,216,196,0.1);
    border:1px solid rgba(31,216,196,0.3);
    padding:6px 14px;
    border-radius:100px;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  h1.hero-headline{
    font-size:clamp(36px, 6.4vw, 68px);
    line-height:1.04;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  h1.hero-headline .grad{
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--magenta), var(--sun), var(--teal));
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    background-clip:text;
    color:transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    font-size:17.5px;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
    max-width:480px;
    margin:0 auto 36px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .hero-note{
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  /* ================= portal slider (signature) ================= */
  .portal-wrap{
    max-width:420px;
    margin:64px auto 0;
  }
  .portal-frame{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:9/14;
    border-radius:28px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:6px solid #0E0919;
    box-shadow:0 50px 100px -30px rgba(255,46,136,0.25), 0 50px 100px -30px rgba(31,216,196,0.15);
  }
  .portal-side{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .side-real{
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #3a3350 0%, #241d38 55%, #150E22 100%);
  }
  .side-remix{
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, #2a0a3d 0%, #4a0e5c 30%, #ff2e88 65%, #ffb84d 100%);
  }
  .figure{
    position:absolute;
    left:50%; bottom:0;
    width:62%;
    height:78%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    border-radius:50% 50% 42% 42% / 55% 55% 40% 40%;
  }
  .side-real .figure{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, #4b4368, #2a2440);
    opacity:0.9;
  }
  .side-remix .figure{
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.14) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.14) 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 10px),
      linear-gradient(200deg, #1fd8c4, #8b5cf6 55%, #ffb84d);
    box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,46,136,0.5);
  }
  .grain{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:3px 3px;
    mix-blend-mode:overlay;
    opacity:.5;
  }
  .scan{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 4px);
    mix-blend-mode:overlay;
  }
  .portal-label{
    position:absolute;
    top:14px;
    font-size:10.5px;
    padding:5px 10px;
    border-radius:100px;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
  .side-real .portal-label{left:14px;}
  .side-remix .portal-label{right:14px;}

  .side-remix{
    clip-path:inset(0 0 0 50%);
  }
  .portal-handle{
    position:absolute;
    top:0; bottom:0;
    left:50%;
    width:0;
    cursor:ew-resize;
    z-index:5;
    touch-action:none;
  }
  .portal-handle-bar{
    position:absolute;
    top:0; bottom:0;
    left:-1px;
    width:2px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, #fff, rgba(255,255,255,0.4));
    box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }
  .portal-handle-grip{
    position:absolute;
    top:50%; left:50%;
    width:44px; height:44px;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  .portal-handle-grip svg{width:18px;height:18px;}
  .portal-caption{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:18px;
    font-size:13px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
  }

  /* ================= world strip ================= */
  .worlds-section{
    padding:90px 0 100px;
  }
  .worlds-head{
    text-align:center;
    max-width:560px;
    margin:0 auto 48px;
  }
  .worlds-head .section-eyebrow{
    color:var(--teal);
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .worlds-head h2{
    font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px);
    line-height:1.15;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .worlds-head p{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .worlds-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:14px;
  }
  @media(min-width:640px){.worlds-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  @media(min-width:960px){.worlds-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);}}
  .world-card{
    border-radius:16px;
    aspect-ratio:3/4;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    padding:14px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:flex-end;
    transition:transform .25s ease;
  }
  .world-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
  .world-card .wname{
    position:relative;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:13.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    font-family:'Unbounded', sans-serif;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .world-card::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55));
  }
  .w-anime{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ff9ecb,#8b5cf6);}
  .w-cyber{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#150E22,#ff2e88 70%);}
  .w-fantasy{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#3a1c71,#ffb84d);}
  .w-underwater{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#003c4d,#1fd8c4);}
  .w-future{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#0f1b2e,#5aa9ff);}
  .w-cartoon{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ff6b6b,#ffd93d);}

  /* ================= how it works (light) ================= */
  .light-section{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:100px 0;
  }
  .section-head-light{
    max-width:560px;
    margin-bottom:56px;
  }
  .section-head-light .section-eyebrow{
    color:var(--magenta);
    font-size:12.5px;
    font-weight:700;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .section-head-light h2{
    font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px);
    line-height:1.15;
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .section-head-light p{
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    gap:0;
  }
  @media(min-width:840px){.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  .step{
    padding:32px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-light);
  }
  @media(min-width:840px){
    .step{border-top:none; border-left:1px solid var(--line-light); padding:4px 30px;}
    .step:first-child{border-left:none; padding-left:0;}
  }
  .step .snum{
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12.5px;
    color:var(--magenta);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .step h3{
    font-size:19px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .step p{
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:14.5px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  /* ================= shareability wall (dark) ================= */
  .wall-section{padding:100px 0 110px;}
  .wall-head{
    text-align:center;
    max-width:560px;
    margin:0 auto 60px;
  }
  .wall-head .section-eyebrow{color:var(--sun); font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .wall-head h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px); line-height:1.15;}
  .wall-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    gap:20px;
    max-width:900px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  @media(min-width:760px){.wall-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}}
  .polaroid{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 10px 16px;
    transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .polaroid:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(0deg) !important;}
  .polaroid:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(-4deg);}
  .polaroid:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(3deg); margin-top:22px;}
  .polaroid:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(-2deg);}
  .polaroid:nth-child(4){transform:rotate(4deg); margin-top:14px;}
  .polaroid-img{
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    border-radius:4px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .p-1{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ff9ecb,#8b5cf6);}
  .p-2{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#003c4d,#1fd8c4);}
  .p-3{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#3a1c71,#ffb84d);}
  .p-4{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#150E22,#ff2e88 70%);}
  .polaroid-cap{
    color:var(--ink);
    font-size:11.5px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .polaroid-cap .stat{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted-light);
    font-size:10.5px;
    margin-top:3px;
    font-family:'Space Mono', monospace;
  }

  /* ================= final cta ================= */
  .final{
    padding:110px 0 70px;
    text-align:center;
    position:relative;
  }
  .final::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    bottom:-100px; left:50%;
    width:800px; height:500px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(255,46,136,0.22), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .final-inner{position:relative;}
  .final h2{
    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);
    line-height:1.08;
    max-width:620px;
    margin:0 auto 20px;
  }
  .final p{
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
    font-size:16px;
    margin-bottom:38px;
  }
  .store-row{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .store-btn{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    padding:12px 20px;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
    border-radius:12px;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:13.5px;
  }
  .store-btn:hover{border-color:#fff;}
  .store-btn .stext{text-align:left;}
  .store-btn .stext .small{display:block; font-size:10px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);}
  .store-btn .stext .big{display:block; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; font-family:'Unbounded', sans-serif;}

  /* ================= footer ================= */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark);
    padding:44px 0;
  }
  .foot-grid{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:24px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  @media(min-width:720px){.foot-grid{flex-direction:row; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;}}
  .foot-links{
    display:flex;
    gap:24px;
    font-size:13px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .foot-links a:hover{color:#fff;}
  .foot-copy{font-size:12.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);}

  /* ================= reveal ================= */
  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px); transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation-duration:.001ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:.001ms !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="logo"><span class="logo-mark"></span>aivio</div>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#worlds">Worlds</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#wall">Shared today</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="#get" class="btn btn-glow">Get the app</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero dark">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">⚡ One tap. Infinite worlds.</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">Turn real life into<br><span class="grad">anywhere else.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Shoot a photo or a short clip. Aivio remixes it into anime, cyberpunk, fantasy, underwater, and worlds that don't have names yet — instantly.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#get" class="btn btn-glow">Try it free</a>
        <a href="#worlds" class="btn btn-outline">See the worlds</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">No sign-up to preview. First remix is on us.</p>

      <div class="portal-wrap">
        <div class="portal-frame" id="portal">
          <div class="portal-side side-real">
            <div class="figure"></div>
            <div class="grain"></div>
            <span class="portal-label mono">YOUR PHOTO</span>
          </div>
          <div class="portal-side side-remix" id="remixSide">
            <div class="figure"></div>
            <div class="scan"></div>
            <span class="portal-label mono">REMIX</span>
          </div>
          <div class="portal-handle" id="portalHandle" role="slider" tabindex="0"
               aria-label="Reveal amount between your photo and the remix"
               aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="50">
            <div class="portal-handle-bar"></div>
            <div class="portal-handle-grip">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#150E22" stroke-width="2"><path d="M8 6L3 12l5 6M16 6l5 6-5 6"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="portal-caption">drag to reveal the remix</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="worlds-section dark" id="worlds">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="worlds-head reveal">
        <div class="section-eyebrow mono">PICK A REALITY</div>
        <h2>Six starting worlds. Endless variations.</h2>
        <p>Every world remixes your original completely differently — same photo, six different lives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="worlds-grid reveal">
        <div class="world-card w-anime"><span class="wname">Anime</span></div>
        <div class="world-card w-cyber"><span class="wname">Cyberpunk</span></div>
        <div class="world-card w-fantasy"><span class="wname">Fantasy</span></div>
        <div class="world-card w-underwater"><span class="wname">Underwater</span></div>
        <div class="world-card w-future"><span class="wname">Future City</span></div>
        <div class="world-card w-cartoon"><span class="wname">Cartoon</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="light-section" id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head-light reveal">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div>
        <h2>From ordinary to unreal in three taps.</h2>
        <p>No editing skills, no timelines, no learning curve — just pick a moment and let it transform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps reveal">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="snum mono">01</span>
          <h3>Shoot or upload</h3>
          <p>Take a photo or short clip right in the app, or pull one from your camera roll.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="snum mono">02</span>
          <h3>Pick a world</h3>
          <p>Choose from anime, cyberpunk, fantasy, and more — or let Aivio surprise you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="snum mono">03</span>
          <h3>Share the remix</h3>
          <p>Your transformed version is ready in seconds, sized and ready for every platform.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wall-section dark" id="wall">
